unit DUK: currency minor 0.01

index yr = year 2025..2030

input growth[y in yr]: num

input spend: money DUK prices 2025 by price_level

def price_level[y in yr]: num at start_of(y)
  note "rule 1: the stated index path as a level with 2025 = 1; a prices read takes only its ratios (L §3.4)"
  rule base v card = price_level[y - 1] * (1 + growth[y])
  rule start_year beats base = 1 when pos(y) == 1

ask q_nominal_2030: round(spend, minor(DUK), half-up) law 2030-01-01

