,18:order/U:ask/ASK-01,11:whole:probe,1:1,36:refused: REQ-ASK no ask zz_m0_probe
,18:order/U:ask/ASK-01,13:whole:reprint,1:0,2087:--- m.tally
model ask01
  tally 2
  on 2025-04-01
  start 2025-03-01
  end 2025-03-31
  note "Probe ASK-01: the first date a balance is below a floor; the month's minimum and its date."

source probe_card "Probe card ASK-01 (made-up story and rules)"

unit DUK: currency minor 0.01

index mday = day 2025-03-01..2025-03-31

place konto: accounts DUK lives 2025-03-01..

place world: outside lives 2025-03-01..

input bank: observed

input low_mark: money DUK

ask q_primitives: first(d in mday where bal(konto, d) < low_mark), min(bal(konto, d) for d in mday), argmin(bal(konto, d) for d in mday) ties by d law 2025-04-01

version card
  cite probe_card
  governs always
  known 2025-03-01
  note "Stipulations, known from the model's start (L §4.5). Rule 1, the balance after each day's rows is the day's balance, is bal(x, d) (L §5.10). The balance stays at its minimum from 25 to 27 March; the card dates the minimum on the day it is reached (25 March), so the argmin ties go to the earliest day."
